[[31,63,0,"<aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>The speedometer drive\ngaer is fitted on the differential even if it is not used.</p></aside>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Remove the speedometer drive gear (1a) using a reaction washer\nand tools (1b) and (1c).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Extractor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.840.005.200</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Clamps</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.840.005.103</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2003976.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the speedometer drive ger back in\nits housing after having heated it to a temperture of 100 to 120 degrees\nC.</p>"],[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the differential internal housing\nin the vice fitted with protective jaws.</p><p>1. Remove the front bearing (1a) using tools (1b) and (1c).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Extractor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.840.005.200</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Clamps</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.840.005.103</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2048691.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<p>1. Remove the speedometer drive gear.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2048692.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the speedometer drive gear.</p><p>1. Fit the front bearing (1a), using a hydraulic press, a suitable\nplate (1b) and the fitting tool (1c).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Tool for Extracting/Fitting</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.658.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2048693.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]]